  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: '- Appears on 2, 3, 4 and 5 reels and substitutes for all


      symbols except              and'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: '- 3 Scatters on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers <color=#ffea00>Jungle Riches
      Free Games.</color>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "- Choose your denomination to win the followings:\n\n    - <color=#6ecc00>Denomination
      1:</color> 6 or more            triggers Re-spin feature with 4 re-spins in
      total.\n\n    - <color=#00a8ff>Denomination 2:</color> 5 or more            triggers
      Re-spin feature with 5 re-spins in total.\n\n    - <color=#ff5959>Denomination
      3:</color> 4 or more            triggers Re-spin feature with 6 re-spins in
      total.\n\n- Total Bet consists of Base Bet and Extra Bet and the below % indicates
      the % of Extra Bet to the Base Bet.\n\n    - <color=#6ecc00>Denomination 1 Extra
      Bet:</color> 0% of Base Bet.\n\n    - <color=#00a8ff>Denomination 2 Extra Bet:</color>
      50% of Base Bet.\n\n    - <color=#ff5959>Denomination 3 Extra Bet:</color> 100%
      of Base Bet."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "- Depending on a selected denomination, <color=#ffea00>Re-spin Feature</color>
      will be triggered with 4, 5, 6 or more Re-spin symbols on reels and triggering
      Re-spin symbols are locked until the Re-spin Feature ends.\n- Each spin, player
      can get additional Re-spin symbols or <color=#ffea00>Golden Re-spin symbols</color>
      on empty spots and if any appears, it will be locked in position as well.\n-
      Each selected                          with Coin Prize contributes its coin
      value to <color=#ffea00>Coin Box</color> panel on the upper right corner.\n\n\n\n-
      Re-spin symbols with Jackpot and Golden Re-spin symbols will be evaluated at
      the end of the Re-spin Feature. \r\n- Each Golden Re-spin symbol collects the
      same amount of Coin Prize as in the Coin Box.\n- You can win Jackpots during
      <color=#ffea00>Re-spin Feature</color> only."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: '- 3 Scatters on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers Jungle Riches Free Games.

      - Your Total Bet during Free Games is the same as the Free Games-triggering
      bet.

      - Player is awarded with 5 Free Games.

      - Retrigger is possible.

      - During Free Games, Re-spin symbol with Coin Prize contributes its value to
      <color=#ffea00>Coin Box</color> panel.

      - Re-spin Feature is not possible to trigger during Jungle Riches Free Games
      but at the end, <color=#ffea00>Re-spin Feature</color> will be triggered as
      a gift!

      - Player starts <color=#ffea00>Re-spin Feature</color> with the sum of the prizes
      on Re-spin symbols collected during Free Games. (1x the Total Bet is guaranteed
      as minimum).

      - You can win Jackpots during <color=#ffea00>Re-spin Feature</color> only.'
